      "text": [
        " «اَلْفِطْرَةُ عَلَيْهِ وَ لاَ تَجُوزُ شَهَادَتُهُ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2072 - Ali ibn Ja'far asked his brother Imam Musa ibn Jafar Al-Kadhim (as) about a mukatab (a slave who has a contract to earn their freedom):\n\"Is Zakat al-Fitr obligatory upon the mukatab or upon the one who wrote the contract of emancipation for him? And is his testimony valid?\"\nImam (as) replied: \"Zakat al-Fitr is obligatory upon him (the mukatab), but his testimony is not valid.\""
        ]
      }
